# React Conventions

## One Component Per File

Each `.tsx` file should contain exactly one React component.

- Export only one component per file (default export)
- File name must match the component name (e.g., `Button.tsx` exports `Button`)
- Helper functions and types used only by that component can stay in the same file
- Types used by multiple files must be placed in `src/types/`
